 src=\"data/img/c343baf5f61c51630e54.svg\" alt=\"\">Scrags Torn Ear</a> <span class=\"muted\">at 581, 679</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"spot\" data-map-id=\"581|679|Bring Nell Parrish Scrag&#39;s torn ear\">Show on map</button></li><li value=\"26\">Kill Old Scrag <span class=\"muted\">at 562, 758</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"spot\" data-map-id=\"562|758|Kill Old Scrag\">Show on map</button><br>Bring Nell Parrish Scrag&#39;s torn ear - <a href=\"#/item/scrags-torn-ear\"><img class=\"g-ico\" src=\"data/img/c343baf5f61c51630e54.svg\" alt=\"\">Scrags Torn Ear</a> <span class=\"muted\">at 582, 679</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"spot\" data-map-id=\"582|679|Bring Nell Parrish Scrag&#39;s torn ear\">Show on map</button></li><li value=\"27\">Kill Old Scrag <span class=\"muted\">at 561, 754</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"spot\" data-map-id=\"561|754|Kill Old Scrag\">Show on map</button><br>Bring Nell Parrish Scrag&#39;s torn ear - <a href=\"#/item/scrags-torn-ear\"><img class=\"g-ico\" src=\"data/img/c343baf5f61c51630e54.svg\" alt=\"\">Scrags Torn Ear</a> <span class=\"muted\">at 581, 679</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"spot\" data-map-id=\"581|679|Bring Nell Parrish Scrag&#39;s torn ear\">Show on map</button></li></ol></section><section id=\"g-rewards\"><h2>Rewards</h2><div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-rewards\"><thead><tr><th>Reward</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Gold</td><td>1,980</td></tr><tr><td>Character XP</td><td>62,000</td></tr><tr><td>Quest points</td><td>1</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section id=\"g-talk\"><h2>What Nell Parrish says</h2><div class=\"q-conv\"><p class=\"q-npc\"><b>Nell Parrish:</b> Good pelts, hardly a hole in them. They&#39;ll go to Fred in the morning.</p><p class=\"q-npc\"><b>Nell Parrish:</b> Now, Marta&#39;s been odd all week. She says something drinks at the well after dark, and she&#39;s been sitting up with a lamp. Go and ask her about it, would you? She won&#39;t tell me. She says I&#39;ll only worry.</p></div><div class=\"q-conv\"><p class=\"q-npc\"><b>Marta Quill:</b> Nell sent you. Of course she did.</p><p class=\"q-npc\"><b>Marta Quill:</b> It&#39;s a jackal, but not like the ones you&#39;ve been killing. He&#39;s big as a calf, gray all over, with one ear torn half off. The diggers call him Old Scrag.</p><p class=\"q-npc\"><b>Marta Quill:</b> He comes up from a den south of the scrapyard and drinks my bucket dry. The last time I chased him off, he didn&#39;t run. He stood there and looked at me.</p><p class=\"q-npc\"><b>Marta Quill:</b> Put him down, please. Nell won&#39;t believe he&#39;s gone without proof, so take her his ear.</p></div><div class=\"q-conv\"><p class=\"q-npc\"><b>Nell Parrish:</b> That&#39;s Scrag&#39;s ear? Marta sat up every night with a lamp over him and never told me what it was.</p><p class=\"q-npc\"><b>Nell Parrish:</b> She&#39;ll sleep now, and so will I. Here&#39;s your pay. The pelts covered some of it.</p></div></section><section id=\"g-end\"><h2>Handing it in</h2><p class=\"q-end\"><i>\"She&#39;ll sleep now, and so will I. Here&#39;s your pay. The pelts covered some of it.\"</i></p></section></div>\n      <aside class=\"wp-infobox g-aside\"><h3>Jerky Weather</h3><p class=\"g-aside-group\">Quests</p><p class=\"g-aside-h\">On this page</p><ol class=\"g-toc\"><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-wastelands-jerky-weather\" data-g-jump=\"g-about\">About</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-wastelands-jerky-weather\" data-g-jump=\"g-needs\">What you need</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-wastelands-jerky-weather\" data-g-jump=\"g-steps\">Steps</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-wastelands-jerky-weather\" data-g-jump=\"g-rewards\">Rewards</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-wastelands-jerky-weather\" data-g-jump=\"g-talk\">What Nell Parrish says</a></li>